# Filled-in VPS deploy env (real operator values); template is scripts/deploy.env.example.
# A glob, not one literal path: the generic `.env.*` rule above only matches basenames
# that start with `.env.`, so a per-environment copy such as scripts/deploy.env.prod was
# committable and would have published real Matomo ids and contact details.
scripts/deploy.env*
!scripts/deploy.env.example

